  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Minor Cursed Technique. Example technique for sorcerers and NPCs (GM approval).</em></p><p>As a bonus action for 2 CE, you create a blue lotus of cursed energy on your body for 1 minute. The next time you take damage, the lotus explodes and showers all creatures of your choice within 10 ft of you with blue petals of cursed energy. They must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 4d4 slashing damage on a failure or half as much damage on a success. You can only have one lotus active at once.</p>",
